msgid "All sub-albums of private albums become private"
msgstr "Toate sub-albumele ale albumelor private devin private"

msgid "As a precaution, following plugins have been deactivated. You must check for plugins upgrade before reactiving them:"
msgstr "Ca precatuie urmatoarele pluginuri au fost dezactivate. Trebuie sa le verifici de actualizari inainte de a le activa"

msgid "As a precaution, following themes have been deactivated. You must check for themes upgrade before reactiving them:"
msgstr "Ca precautie urmatoarele teme au fost dezactivate. Trebuie sa verifici de actualizari inainte de a le activa."

msgid "In <i>%s</i>, before <b>?></b>, insert:"
msgstr "In <i>%s</i>, inainte de <b>?></b>, insert:"

msgid "Only administrator can run upgrade: please sign in below."
msgstr "Numai un administrator poate face upgrade. Te rog logheaza-te mai jos."

msgid "Only thumbnails prefix and webmaster mail address have been saved from previous configuration"
msgstr "Numai prefixurile thumbnailurilor si adresa de mail a webmasterului au fost salvate"

msgid "Perform a maintenance check in [Administration>Tools>Maintenance] if you encounter any problem."
msgstr "Ruleaza o verificare de mentenanta in [Administration>Tools>Maintenance] daca intampini probleme"

msgid "SQL queries"
msgstr "Interogari SQL"

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistici"

msgid "This page proposes to upgrade your database corresponding to your old version of Piwigo to the current version. The upgrade assistant thinks you are currently running a <strong>release %s</strong> (or equivalent)."
msgstr "Aceasta pagina upgradeaza baza de date de la o versiunea mai veche de Piwigo la cea noua.\nIn acest moment rulezi <strong>release %s</strong>"

msgid "total SQL time"
msgstr "timpul total SQL"

msgid "total upgrade time"
msgstr "Timpul total pentru upgrade"

msgid "Upgrade from version %s to %s"
msgstr "Upgradeaza de la versiunea  %s la %s"

msgid "Upgrade informations"
msgstr "Informatiile pentru upgrade"

msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Upgradeaza"

msgid "User permissions and group permissions have been erased"
msgstr "Userii si permisiunile grupurilor au fost sterse"

msgid "You do not have access rights to run upgrade"
msgstr "Nu ai acces pentru a face upgrade"

msgid "Discover what's new in Piwigo %s"
msgstr "Descopera ce este nou in Piwigo %s"

